OL,3,GNEWSA'First recorded' sighting of a
OL,4,AScottish wildcat swimming
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scottish wildcat has been recorded
OL,7,Fswimming in the wild for the first
OL,8,Ftime, according to a conservation
OL,9,Fproject.
OL,11,FThe female, which was born in captivity
OL,12,Fin 2022 and released into the wild in
OL,13,F2024, was spotted by a group of friends
OL,14,Fcanoeing on the River Spey earlier this
OL,15,Fsummer.
OL,17,FSaving Wildcats, which involves the
OL,18,FRoyal Zoological Society of Scotland
OL,19,F(RZSS), identified the cat because it
OL,20,Fhas a GPS radio collar which allows it
OL,21,Fto be tracked.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
