OL,3,GNEWSA'First recorded' sighting of a
OL,4,AScottish wildcat swimming
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe wildcat, called Sully, was released
OL,7,Fas part of the project's efforts to
OL,8,Fboost numbers of the animals in the
OL,9,FCairngorms National Park.
